      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n\nNo. 108 WestPoint, Donegal Town F94 V9FW\n\nImpressive 3 B/r Semi-Detached Residence \n\nOnly 5 min walk from The Diamond\n\n\nSituate adjoining open green area and situate only 500 metres from The Diamond. Constructed in 2023 and extending to 111 sq.m. (1194 sq.ft.)\n\nCompleted throughout to a very high standard and comprising -\n\nLiving Room, Kitchen with Dining Area, W.C.; 3 No. Bedrooms (1 en-suite) & Bathroom\n\nTo the rear is an enclosed patio together with Home Office and Storage Shed. \n\n\nEntrance Hallway5.38 m. x 1.79 m.\nTiled floor\n\nLiving Room4.27 m. x 3.94 m.\nLaminated floor; beautiful built-in display and T.V. Wall cabinet with electric fire installed; blinds, curtains & light fittingsincluded; lower walls timber panelled Two windows, one of which overlooks green area\n\n \n\nKitchen / Dining5.82 m. x 3.91 m.\nTiled floor; fitted units with integrated fridge freezer, eye level double oven; centre island with sink and integrated dishwasher; sliding door to rear\n\n \n\nUtilityWashing Machine & Tumble Dryer included\n\nW.C.Toilet & Wash Basin; lower walls timber panelled\n\nFirst Floor.\n\nLandingWalk-in Storage / Wardrobe\n\nBedroom No. 13.78 m. x 3.08 m.\nCarpet; Overlooking green area\n\n\nBedroom No. 23.74 m. x 2.59 m.\nCarpet\n\nBedroom No. 34.01 m. x 3.89 m.\nCarpet; stand alone wardrobe\n\nEn-suiteElectric Shower, toilet and wash basin\n\nBathroomPower Shower, toilet and wash basin; tiled floor and lower walls\n\nLiving Area 111 sq.metres (1194 sq.ft.)\n\nBER - A2Ber No. 116075011\n\nComprised in Folio DL 95802F\n\n\nTo the rear is an enclosed open area, currently in gravelled stone but ideal for garden; included is a \n\nDetached Timber Building divided into \n\nHome Office - 3.08 m. x 2.81 m.\n\nStorage Area2.81 m. x 1.50 m.\n\n \n\nAnderson Auctioneers for itself and as agent for the vendor gives notice that:\n\nThese particulars are only a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees and do not constitute, in whole or in part, an offer or a Contract.\n\nAny intending purchaser or lessee should satisfy themselves by inspection, searches, inquiries, and survey as to the correctness of each statement.\n\n[OR] Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted, and intending purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information given.\n\nAll statements in these particulars are made on the without responsibility part of Anderson Auctioneers or the vendor \n\nNo statement in these particulars is to be relied upon as a statement or representation of fact.\n\nNeither Anderson Auctioneers nor anyone in its employment or acting on its behalf has authority to make any representation or warranty in relation to this property.\n\nNothing in these particulars shall be deemed to be a statement that the property is in good repair or condition, or otherwise, nor that any services or facilities are in good working order.\n\nPhotographs may show only certain parts and aspects of the property at the time when the photographs were taken, and you should rely upon actual inspection.\n\nNo assumption should be made regarding parts of the property not shown in photographs.\n\nAny areas, measurements, or distances are only approximate.\n\nAny reference to alterations or use is not intended to be a statement that any necessary planning, building regulation, listed building, or any other consent has been obtained. \n"
